[
  {
    "RowOffset": 541342,
    "RowId": 33102,
    "Text": "The castle answers his call...<<key>>We'd do well to break up this feast quickly."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 541434,
    "RowId": 33103,
    "Text": "戦闘が長引くとまずそうね……。"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 541490,
    "RowId": 33104,
    "Text": "Then let's see these guests on their way."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 541542,
    "RowId": 33105,
    "Text": "Behold the power of the archfiend of earth!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 541598,
    "RowId": 33106,
    "Text": "He hastens their regeneration!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 541642,
    "RowId": 33107,
    "Text": "We are deathlessssss.<<key>>You cannot defeat that which cannot die!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 541718,
    "RowId": 33108,
    "Text": "ゆえに、貴様らに勝ち目はない！"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 541774,
    "RowId": 33109,
    "Text": "Struggle and slaughter all you like!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 541822,
    "RowId": 33110,
    "Text": "Our foe has too great an advantage..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 541870,
    "RowId": 33111,
    "Text": "We need to drag him out of this damnable feast."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 541930,
    "RowId": 33112,
    "Text": "There's no end in sight...<<key>>A retreat may be in order."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 541998,
    "RowId": 33113,
    "Text": "一度退いて、策を練った方がよさそうね。"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 542066,
    "RowId": 33114,
    "Text": "However incurred, a debt is a debt.<<key>>I will repay it here and now."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 542146,
    "RowId": 33115,
    "Text": "この戦いに加勢することで、チャラにしてもらうぞ。"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 542230,
    "RowId": 33116,
    "Text": "What is this power?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 542262,
    "RowId": 33117,
    "Text": "You will tremble before my true ssstrength!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 542318,
    "RowId": 33118,
    "Text": "Know your end is nigh!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 542354,
    "RowId": 33119,
    "Text": "Attend to the minions first."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 542394,
    "RowId": 33120,
    "Text": "Finally getting serious, are we?<<key>>Very well, let us return the favor!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 542478,
    "RowId": 33121,
    "Text": "ならば、こっちも全力でいくぞ！"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 542534,
    "RowId": 33122,
    "Text": "Trickery will not save you!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 542574,
    "RowId": 33123,
    "Text": "Enough! <i>Enough</i>!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 542610,
    "RowId": 33124,
    "Text": "We cannot win without Zero. We must help her!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 542666,
    "RowId": 33125,
    "Text": "Hmph. If I must deal with <i>you</i> first...<<key>>I'll kill you all myself!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 542754,
    "RowId": 33126,
    "Text": "Pathetic! Useless!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 542786,
    "RowId": 33127,
    "Text": "I'll kill you all myself!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 542822,
    "RowId": 33128,
    "Text": "This place will be your grave!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 542866,
    "RowId": 33129,
    "Text": "This magick... We must stop him <i>now</i>!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 542926,
    "RowId": 33130,
    "Text": "Defeat all enemies."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 542958,
    "RowId": 33131,
    "Text": "Defeat Scarmiglione!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 542990,
    "RowId": 33132,
    "Text": "She can turn voidsent into crystal..."
  },
