  {
    "RowOffset": 547970,
    "RowId": 33399,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 547982,
    "RowId": 33400,
    "Text": "I will suffer none to oppose Lord van Baelsar!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 548042,
    "RowId": 33401,
    "Text": "Like countless other challengers, you will fall before me!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 548114,
    "RowId": 33402,
    "Text": "My shields are impregnable!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 548154,
    "RowId": 33403,
    "Text": "Your defeat will bring Lord van Baelsar's noble conquest one step closer to fruition!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 548250,
    "RowId": 33404,
    "Text": "Ugh... So this is the strength of <If(PlayerParameter(4))>she<Else/>he</If> who vanquished Titan..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 548334,
    "RowId": 33405,
    "Text": "Let us aid you, my lord!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 548370,
    "RowId": 33406,
    "Text": "What? I thought I ordered you to leave!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 548422,
    "RowId": 33407,
    "Text": "Forgive us, my lord, but we couldn't let you face the enemy alone!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 548502,
    "RowId": 33408,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 548514,
    "RowId": 33409,
    "Text": "Your conviction and courage will not be for naught! This I swear!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 548590,
    "RowId": 33410,
    "Text": "For victory and vengeance, I will strike you down!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 548654,
    "RowId": 33411,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 548666,
    "RowId": 33412,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 548678,
    "RowId": 33413,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 548690,
    "RowId": 33414,
    "Text": "Hah, I have you now!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 548722,
    "RowId": 33415,
    "Text": "We shall go together, amidst a raging inferno!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 548782,
    "RowId": 33416,
    "Text": "No amount of pain can loosen my grip!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 548830,
    "RowId": 33417,
    "Text": "Ungh... You will not escape..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 548874,
    "RowId": 33418,
    "Text": "Rest in peace, men... I shall join you soon..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 548934,
    "RowId": 33419,
    "Text": "\\\\<pant> \\\\<pant> It's over... Strong as you are, you cannot survive this!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 549018,
    "RowId": 33420,
    "Text": "Defeat Rhitahtyn sas Arvina"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 549058,
    "RowId": 33421,
    "Text": "Defeat Rhitahtyn's minions"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 549098,
    "RowId": 33422,
    "Text": "Defeat Rhitahtyn sas Arvina again"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 549142,
    "RowId": 33423,
    "Text": "Flee, damn you! Flee while you still can!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 549194,
    "RowId": 33424,
    "Text": "Let me show you a technique passed down in my homeland!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 549262,
    "RowId": 33425,
    "Text": "You do not hold back! Very well, neither shall I!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 549322,
    "RowId": 33426,
    "Text": "Ignore pain... Ignite rage... And fight with the fury of wildfire!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 549402,
    "RowId": 33427,
    "Text": "You will have no mercy from me!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 549446,
    "RowId": 33428,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 549458,
    "RowId": 33429,
    "Text": "We've raised the alarm as you bade...and now we would fight with you!"
  },
