  {
    "RowOffset": 550378,
    "RowId": 33500,
    "Text": "Arrive at the central crossing"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 550422,
    "RowId": 33501,
    "Text": "Clear the central crossing"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 550462,
    "RowId": 33502,
    "Text": "Arrive at Area V"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 550490,
    "RowId": 33503,
    "Text": "Clear Area V"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 550514,
    "RowId": 33504,
    "Text": "Arrive at the parade ground"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 550554,
    "RowId": 33505,
    "Text": "Defeat Livia sas Junius"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 550590,
    "RowId": 33506,
    "Text": "This is Cid. To review, our goal is to deactivate the magitek field."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 550670,
    "RowId": 33507,
    "Text": "If you could create a diversion─that's to say, wreak lots of havoc─I'll search for the field generator."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 550790,
    "RowId": 33508,
    "Text": "<split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>, how are you faring? ...Reached a dead end, you say? I believe I know where you are."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 550902,
    "RowId": 33509,
    "Text": "There's a disposal chute nearby. Find it and jump in, and you'll emerge in a different sector."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 551010,
    "RowId": 33510,
    "Text": "<split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>, assault crafts are near! Watch out for incoming fire!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 551094,
    "RowId": 33511,
    "Text": "I've located the controls for the security system. A moment while I disable the barriers."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 551194,
    "RowId": 33512,
    "Text": "Another bulkhead, eh? Fortunately I'm equipped for the task. Stand back!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 551278,
    "RowId": 33513,
    "Text": "Come on, the field generator should be just up ahead!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 551342,
    "RowId": 33514,
    "Text": "There it is! Keep the enemy occupied while I take it out of commission!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 551426,
    "RowId": 33515,
    "Text": "You will <i>not</i> take any more from me!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 551482,
    "RowId": 33516,
    "Text": "The pain I have suffered, I shall visit upon you a hundredfold!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 551558,
    "RowId": 33517,
    "Text": "You have made me <i>wroth</i>!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 551602,
    "RowId": 33518,
    "Text": "Hmph, you're tough, I grant you that."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 551650,
    "RowId": 33519,
    "Text": "But I will break you soon enough!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 551694,
    "RowId": 33520,
    "Text": "You will not defeat me! <i>You will not</i>!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 551754,
    "RowId": 33521,
    "Text": "I'm also pleased to say I've found a suit of armor. Press on─I'll meet you just ahead."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 551854,
    "RowId": 33522,
    "Text": "Damn, reinforcements! Take care of them, would you?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 551918,
    "RowId": 33523,
    "Text": "We must hold the enemy here! All units─attack!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 551978,
    "RowId": 33524,
    "Text": "The central crossing is overrun! Requesting immediate reinforcements!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 552058,
    "RowId": 33525,
    "Text": "Gah, damn these savages! Deploy the reserve colossi!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 552122,
    "RowId": 33526,
    "Text": "How can this be...? R-Reinforcements! We need more reinforcements!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 552202,
    "RowId": 33527,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 552214,
    "RowId": 33528,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 552226,
    "RowId": 33529,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 552238,
    "RowId": 33530,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 552250,
    "RowId": 33600,
    "Text": "We have seen the end."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 552282,
    "RowId": 33601,
    "Text": "The same end, again and again."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 552326,
    "RowId": 33602,
    "Text": "All of us have known despair."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 552366,
    "RowId": 33603,
    "Text": "A sorrow so deep only emptiness remains."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 552418,
    "RowId": 33604,
    "Text": " 'Tis so lonely between the stars."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 552466,
    "RowId": 33605,
    "Text": "As surely as stars fall from the heavens, all civilizations are destined to die."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 552558,
    "RowId": 33606,
    "Text": "This is fate!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 552582,
    "RowId": 33607,
    "Text": "All light is destined to fade─all happiness give way to suffering."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 552662,
    "RowId": 33608,
    "Text": "Embrace the quiet!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 552694,
    "RowId": 33609,
    "Text": "Utterly futile."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 552722,
    "RowId": 33610,
    "Text": "Your suffering is at an end."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 552762,
    "RowId": 33611,
    "Text": "Ahhh, it comes flooding back. The memory of a star ravaged by disease."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 552846,
    "RowId": 33612,
    "Text": "Quick as a shadow, doom comes to claim us."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 552902,
    "RowId": 33613,
    "Text": "Ever shall we sing, our voice resounding throughout the vast expanse."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 552982,
    "RowId": 33614,
    "Text": "Unto you we shall deliver the answer of all the lives that came before."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 553066,
    "RowId": 33615,
    "Text": "No life, no star, nor the universe itself..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 553122,
    "RowId": 33616,
    "Text": "None should hope for better!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 553162,
    "RowId": 33617,
    "Text": "We cannot suffer it again..."
  },
